                "category": "defensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature the cephalophix perceives with a precise sense Casts a Spell</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The cephalophix attempts to counteract the triggering spell. Their counteract rank is 3, and their counteract modifier is +13. If they succeed, the triggering creature takes mental damage equal to twice the counteracted spell's rank.</p>"
