                "category": "defensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> The cephalophix takes acid, cold, electricity, fire, sonic, or spirit damage</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The cephalophix loses any resistances they have to acid, cold, electricity, fire, sonic, or spirit damage, then gains resistance 5 to the triggering damage type. This resistance applies to the triggering damage and lasts until they use Reactive Resistance again.</p>"
