                "actions": {
                    "value": null
                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>Creatures hit by a cephalophix's Strikes are covered in black tar suffused with unholy energy. They take a –5-foot status penalty to their Speeds until the end of their next turn (or a –10-foot status penalty on a critical hit), and they must succeed at a @Check[will|dc:22] save or be @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Stupefied]{Stupefied 1} for the same duration (@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Stupefied]{Stupefied 2} on a critical failure).</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-effects.Item.Effect: Tar Vomit (Speed Penalty)]</p>"
                },
